1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
{\an8}SKERRY POINT - EPISODE ONE

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,025
Eleven weeks, Ivo. Eleven.

3
00:00:06,425 --> 00:00:08,988
- Who is counting?
- The log is counting.

4
00:00:09,388 --> 00:00:11,013
The log counts everything.

5
00:00:11,413 --> 00:00:12,725
It counted the gulls.

6
00:00:13,125 --> 00:00:14,500
There were nine gulls.

7
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,150
- Four.
- Nine, Ivo.

8
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:19,175
<i>The lamp turns. Nobody looks at it.</i>

9
00:00:19,575 --> 00:00:21,638
The Light does not like the cold.

10
00:00:22,037 --> 00:00:23,475
The Light is a machine.

11
00:00:23,875 --> 00:00:25,312
The Light has opinions.

12
00:00:25,712 --> 00:00:27,087
Write that in the log.

13
00:00:27,487 --> 00:00:30,112
I will write that the keeper has opinions.

14
00:00:30,512 --> 00:00:31,712
- Marta.
- Ivo.

15
00:00:32,112 --> 00:00:33,312
Is it on?

16
00:00:33,712 --> 00:00:34,912
It is on.

17
00:00:35,312 --> 00:00:36,562
Then it was resting.

18
00:00:36,962 --> 00:00:38,162
Do not start.

19
00:00:38,562 --> 00:00:41,312
<i>Ninety-eight stairs. Or ninety-seven.</i>

20
00:00:41,712 --> 00:00:42,912
Ninety-seven!

21
00:00:43,312 --> 00:00:44,750
The landing is a stair.

22
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:46,712
The landing is a landing.

23
00:00:47,112 --> 00:00:48,612
{\an8}END OF EPISODE ONE

